  "body": "The preface currently says:\r\n\r\n```\r\nTherefore for new protocols and formats, as well as existing formats deployed in new contexts,\r\nthis specification requires (and defines) the UTF-8 encoding...\r\n```\r\n\r\nA minimal change would be to add a comma after \"Therefore\", so the preposition reads correctly. But I think the best fix would be to delete \"Therefore\". The text would then be:\r\n\r\n```\r\nFor new protocols and formats, as well as existing formats deployed in new contexts,\r\nthis specification requires (and defines) the UTF-8 encoding...\r\n```",
